    </credit>
  </info>

  <title>Payment receipt</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Customer</gui><gui>Payment receipt</gui></guiseq> prints a
  receipt for a payment already recorded in <link
  xref="customer_payment"/>.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Customer</gui>, or check <gui>View all</gui> to
    list every customer's payments. Each payment shows how it was paid and the
    invoice it paid.</p></item>
    <item><p>Select the payment.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Generate payment receipt</gui> to open the receipt in
    LibreOffice, where it can be changed before printing.</p></item>
    <item><p>Or click <gui>Post payment receipt</gui> to keep a copy of the
    receipt with the payment and print it.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p><gui>View payment receipt</gui> opens the copy kept with the selected
  payment, if a receipt was posted for it.</p>

</page>
